build/
build.log
Frameworks/*
bin/*
lib/*
data/opencc/
data/plum/
download/
package/Linnet*.pkg
package/release/
# Local static/UAT candidates are historical build evidence, never source or
# inputs to a later accepted revision. Keep them readable without making the
# clean-revision signing boundary depend on deleting prior evidence.
package/candidate*/
package/sign/*.pem
*linnet-pack-ed25519.key
package/test-*
package/generate_keys
package/sign_update
*~
.*.swp
.DS_Store
# Local Python environments and bytecode embed machine-specific paths and are
# never source or release inputs.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Chinese data pipeline: generated dictionaries, provenance and reports are
# committed — scripts/stage-linnet-data consumes data/chinese/generated in
# fresh checkouts, and the upstream-update PR carries them as evidence.
# Only the update work/cache area stays local.
data/chinese/cache/
# The locked Wanxiang LTS grammar model (420 MB) is downloaded on demand by
# action-install.sh from the RIME-LMDG release URL in upstreams.lock.json;
# it must never be committed.
data/chinese/grammar/
# Local agent indexes and one-off generated backups are never release inputs.
.serena/
data/chinese/reports/*.bak
